      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I made a reference image for this. Anything outside that center square is either cropped out in the QM and (old) main menu (horizontal letterbox), or cropped in the Wing Menu (vertical letterbox).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
