  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-13T04:23:29.318Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When uploaded, a thumbnail is\n4:3, but when viewed in the user profile, it's cropped to 16:9. As if that wasn't enough, in the remaining menus it's cropped to 16:9, then also stretched horizontally to an arbitrary ratio. I'd make thumbnails easier to make and prettier to look at if these ratios were consistent; I'd recommend 4:3 across the board.\n\nEdit: In the new wing menu (as of 10/13/21), the avatar thumbnails are cropped to 1:1",
